            <title>[LU-19404] aarch64 sanity-lnet test_50: FAIL: Import failed rc = 234</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19404</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for jianyu &amp;lt;yujian@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/af2da614-1453-4274-8a70-1bca72018690" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/af2da614-1453-4274-8a70-1bca72018690&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_50 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;== sanity-lnet test 50: Enable/disable routing via yaml import ========================================================== 12:33:04 (1758371584)
/usr/sbin/lnetctl lnet unconfigure
/usr/sbin/lnetctl lnet configure
Enable routing
/usr/sbin/lnetctl import /tmp/sanity-lnet-50.yaml
---
add:
-     import:
      errno: -12
      descr: ! "Out of memory"
...
 sanity-lnet test_50: @@@@@@ FAIL: Import failed rc = 234 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/116772" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/116772&lt;/a&gt; - 5.14.0-503.40.1.el9_5.aarch64+64k&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/116772" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/116772&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.71.1.el8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;Please provide additional information about the failure here&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;







